  "claim": "Exact: parity of three held points is realizable at an interface of the bare 8-point torus (2,0,4) and of a memory made of the knot sphere K_2 with that torus grown as an atom. Computed, frozen: the unchanged credit learner with the three-input sturdier probe learned parity from its eight examples and held it after a disturbance in 10 of 10 runs on each space, switched it to its negation and back (60 of 60 writes), with no inexact stop; median 13,400 and 18,000 steps.",
